      "text": "116,920.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **356** and **320**, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n   \n   \\[\n   356 \\times 320 = 356 \\times (300 + 20)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 356 by 300:**\n   \n   \\[\n   356 \\times 300 = 106,\\!800\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 356 by 20:**\n   \n   \\[\n   356 \\times 20 = 7,\\!120\n   \\]\n\n4. **Add the two results together:**\n   \n   \\[\n   106,\\!800 + 7,\\!120 = 113,\\!920\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, the product of **356** and **320** is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{113,\\!920}\n\\]",
